<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 18:04:07 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>他的家人带着 1 卢布逃离了苏联。现在，亿万富翁伊戈尔·图尔钦斯基 (Igor Tulchinsky) 支持 2026 年欧洲最大的展览</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/igor-tulchinsky-soviet-union-bayeux-tapestry-exhibition/</link><description>图尔钦斯基向大英博物馆捐赠了 680 万美元，以支持这次展览，查尔斯国王称其为“非凡的艺术品”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20260907_BRITISHMUSEUM_SHOT_02_098-f1png-1.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 11:50:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/igor-tulchinsky-soviet-union-bayeux-tapestry-exhibition/</guid></item><item><title>史蒂夫·乔布斯让苹果成为了标志。蒂姆·库克 (Tim Cook) 将其打造成 5 万亿美元的庞然大物</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/tim-cook-apple-ceo-legacy-stock-price-growth-services-supply-chain/</link><description>库克让乔布斯的 iPhone 成为全球霸主，并将苹果公司扩展为一个广阔的、能产生现金的生态系统。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2233948297-e1789739770147.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/tim-cook-apple-ceo-legacy-stock-price-growth-services-supply-chain/</guid></item><item><title>苹果的第一个 50 年：图表显示这家 iPhone 制造商如何成为价值 4.85 万亿美元的巨头</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/apple-first-50-years-history-iphone-mac-services-revenue-growth-timeline/</link><description>从数字上看，苹果公司已转型为全球消费科技巨头。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-175779374.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/apple-first-50-years-history-iphone-mac-services-revenue-growth-timeline/</guid></item><item><title>Fortescue 斥资数十亿美元实现采矿业脱碳并帮助重建乌克兰</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/andrew-forrest-fortescue-decarbonization-plan-ukraine-reconstruction/</link><description>安德鲁·福雷斯特 (Andrew Forrest) 将 Fortescue 打造成铁矿石巨头。现在，他正投入数十亿美元加速澳大利亚的清洁能源改革，并在战斗结束后帮助乌克兰复兴，这是一项不太可能的努力。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FOR-Forrest-social-thumbnail.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 08:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/andrew-forrest-fortescue-decarbonization-plan-ukraine-reconstruction/</guid></item><item><title>Meta 如何在后智能手机世界的竞争中取得领先地位</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/meta-ai-smart-glasses-privacy-wearables-hardware-race-openai-apple-snap/</link><description>尽管隐私问题一直存在，但 Meta 在智能眼镜领域的领先地位、强大的雷朋合作伙伴关系以及时尚第一的战略使 Meta 处于领先地位。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Dev-Meta-Capri-also-use-for-social-thumbnail.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/meta-ai-smart-glasses-privacy-wearables-hardware-race-openai-apple-snap/</guid></item><item><title>特拉维斯·卡兰尼克（Travis Kalanick）回归：被赶下台的 Uber 创始人如何从贱民变成硅谷英雄</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/24/travis-kalanick-uber-comeback-atoms-ai-robotics-cloud-kitchens-silicon-valley/</link><description>这位 Uber 联合创始人带着价值数十亿美元的机器人和人工智能企业回归，而科技行业也更容易接受他的强硬态度。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Travis-Kalanick-social-image.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/24/travis-kalanick-uber-comeback-atoms-ai-robotics-cloud-kitchens-silicon-valley/</guid></item><item><title>社交媒体如何重塑奢华腕表市场</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/how-social-media-is-changing-the-rare-watch-market-instagram-tiktok-watch-collecting/</link><description>新一代年轻收藏家正在网上发现古董卡地亚、百达翡丽和江诗丹顿。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/PAS_Raoul-Shamshad__horizontal-for-social.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/how-social-media-is-changing-the-rare-watch-market-instagram-tiktok-watch-collecting/</guid></item><item><title>蒂姆·库克的成长历程：即将离任的苹果首席执行官如何从“史蒂夫·乔布斯背后的天才”成为明星</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/becoming-tim-cook-apple-ceo/</link><description>《财富》杂志从 2008 年到 2017 年的报道追溯了库克从运营主管晋升为苹果首席执行官的历程。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2218819402-e1790015891262.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/becoming-tim-cook-apple-ceo/</guid></item><item><title>您的 401(k) 正在资助人工智能的繁荣。这对您的退休意味着什么</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/how-ai-stock-market-concentration-could-put-401k-retirement-savings-at-risk/</link><description>被动投资革命本应分散风险。相反，它使数百万工人的储蓄与大型科技公司的命运更加紧密地联系在一起。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moscoso_Fortune_AI401K_ALT_Web-e1789761902141.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/how-ai-stock-market-concentration-could-put-401k-retirement-savings-at-risk/</guid></item><item><title>Palo Alto Networks 的 Nikesh Arora 正在构建针对人工智能黑暗面的防御措施</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/nikesh-arora-palo-alto-networks-ceo-ai-cybersecurity-defense/</link><description>网络安全的人工智能清算已经到来，阿罗拉已成为首席执行官的首选顾问。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/NEW_Nikesh_Arora.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/nikesh-arora-palo-alto-networks-ceo-ai-cybersecurity-defense/</guid></item></channel></rss>